  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute spikes in cross-border strikes that damage ports, energy nodes or logistics hubs produce abrupt cross-asset risk‑off flows and forced reallocations that overwhelm dealer capacity and liquidity in the Treasury market, producing order imbalances and disorderly price moves.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_treasury_bond_crisis</data>
</edge>
