  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in defensive resupply (accelerators, electronics, logistics) consumes constrained global manufacturing, testing and shipping capacity and component inventories, crowding out delivery slots and inputs available for commercial AI hardware.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
