  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in military resupply shipments to Europe and adjacent theatres consumes container, roll‑on/roll‑off and air cargo capacity and creates input shortages, prompting North American firms to accelerate near‑sourcing and relocation of production away from exposed foreign suppliers.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_canada_trade_war</data>
</edge>
