  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden drop in crude throughput through Gulf chokepoints sharply raises global oil prices and inflation expectations, which directly lifts term premia and pushes up long‑maturity government bond yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
