  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising military intensity in the Gulf raises disruption risk and insurance/lead‑time uncertainty for globally integrated suppliers, prompting firms to simplify and regionalize production relationships and thereby reduce US–Canada supply‑chain integration.</data>
