  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher applied tariffs on semiconductor, accelerator and server imports raise landed costs and discourage timely shipments and stocking by resellers, directly reducing the market-available quantity of AI-targeted hardware.</data>
