  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A faster pace of reciprocal trade measures increases policy and exit risk for cross-border AI ventures, prompting LPs and corporates to pull or re-allocate funding away from binational AI projects and startups.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_canada_trade_war</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_ai_superpower_rival</data>
</edge>
