<edge source="us_canada_trade_war::supply_chain_integ" target="russia_ukraine_war::logistics_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Reduced US–Canada supply‑chain integration (fewer coordinated production stages and just‑in‑time links) immediately degrades the cross‑border logistics networks and spare‑parts pipelines that carriers and freight forwarders rely on to sustain large outbound shipments to the theatre, lowering overall logistics operational capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
